  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bird ringing coop grant PDC</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ringm&#xe4;rkning PDC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Information collected through bird ringing is becoming important in   monitoring of environment and climate change, bio-diversity,          tick-borne diseases and avian flu. Swedish Museum of National         History, NRM, is collaborating with National Bird Banding Centre      (NBBC) at the Chinese Academy of Forestry (CAF)to raise capacity in   Bird banding.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Information som erh&#xe5;lls genom ringm&#xe4;rkning av f&#xe5;glar blir alltmer     betydelsefull f&#xf6;r att f&#xf6;lja milj&#xf6;- och klimatf&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndringar,            biodiversitet, spridning av smittsamma sjukdomar via f&#xe4;stingar och    f&#xe5;gelinfluensa. Samarbete mellan Naturhistoriska Riksmuseet (NRM) i   samarbete med National Bird Banding Centre (NBBC) vid Chinese Academy of Forestry (CAF)f&#xf6;r att h&#xf6;ja kapaciteten inom ringm&#xe4;rkning i Kina</narrative>
  </description>
